(3071822, 431853, 68372, '<td valign="top">Good picture, but there is something missing to this pic<br/>About the composition:<br/>No rule of third, making the picture weak (to centre the main subject you would need to crop it much closer to make it interesting)<br/>Background is a little distracting, it could be more out of focus. This would create less competition between main subject and background.<br/>This picture could be cropped much tighter, seeing less background and making the swan more dominant. <br/> <br/>The contrast of the picture is very good.<br/>And good lighting on the swan.</td>', 'Good picture, but there is something missing to this picAbout the composition:No rule of third, making the picture weak (to centre the main subject you would need to crop it much closer to make it interesting)Background is a little distracting, it could be more out of focus. This would create less competition between main subject and background.This picture could be cropped much tighter, seeing less background and making the swan more dominant.  The contrast of the picture is very good.And good lighting on the swan.', '2006-11-29 11:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3071827, 432660, 17148, '<td valign="top">Looks tasty though</td>', 'Looks tasty though', '2006-11-29 12:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
