(3071884, 432665, 68657, '<td valign="top">Loved it! 10! :-)</td>', 'Loved it! 10! :-)', '2006-11-29 12:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3071912, 431283, 51185, '<td valign="top">Haha this is something my children would do (when i have them)</td>', 'Haha this is something my children would do (when i have them)', '2006-11-29 12:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3071968, 432062, 67006, '<td valign="top">Seems like this was supposed to be an entry for the Bond challenge....</td>', 'Seems like this was supposed to be an entry for the Bond challenge....', '2006-11-29 12:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3071980, 430696, 69183, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. I like the angle, as it turns a normal landscape into an action shot. The grass colouring looks oddly uniform - was it genuinely that colour?</td>', 'Nice photo. I like the angle, as it turns a normal landscape into an action shot. The grass colouring looks oddly uniform - was it genuinely that colour?', '2006-11-29 12:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072002, 430958, 69183, '<td valign="top">I have my suspicions about what this is, but I''m not 100% sure. Nice use of colour, and I like the reflections of the... umm... thing :)</td>', 'I have my suspicions about what this is, but I''m not 100% sure. Nice use of colour, and I like the reflections of the... umm... thing :)', '2006-11-29 12:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072022, 432579, 69183, '<td valign="top">This is eerie. The foreground and high sky are so clear compared to the ghostly buildings in the middle. It almost looks like a composite of several images (I''m not saying it *is*, just that it looks like it). Very nice.</td>', 'This is eerie. The foreground and high sky are so clear compared to the ghostly buildings in the middle. It almost looks like a composite of several images (I''m not saying it *is*, just that it looks like it). Very nice.', '2006-11-29 12:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072037, 432610, 69183, '<td valign="top">Interesting colours. It''s a shame that the elephant''s looking away, and also that it has red-eye; I think this detracts from the similar colours on the skin.</td>', 'Interesting colours. It''s a shame that the elephant''s looking away, and also that it has red-eye; I think this detracts from the similar colours on the skin.', '2006-11-29 13:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072046, 431260, 69183, '<td valign="top">I like light, and the way the foreground branches are distinct from the background trees - a good contrast. Nice photo.</td>', 'I like light, and the way the foreground branches are distinct from the background trees - a good contrast. Nice photo.', '2006-11-29 13:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072050, 432447, 69183, '<td valign="top">Very nice! The subject''s skin isn''t overexposed and shows lots of detail. I like the slight shadows from her hair, and the intent stare into the camera. Top stuff :)</td>', 'Very nice! The subject''s skin isn''t overexposed and shows lots of detail. I like the slight shadows from her hair, and the intent stare into the camera. Top stuff :)', '2006-11-29 13:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072057, 432784, 68372, '<td valign="top">Good picture.  Beautiful sky.<br/>And I especially like the orientation of the light. (Good shadow effect!)</td>', 'Good picture.  Beautiful sky.And I especially like the orientation of the light. (Good shadow effect!)', '2006-11-29 13:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072063, 430958, 58610, '<td valign="top">Even though I don''t even want to know what it is, I think this is the best photo in the challenge. Well designed and executed. Great composition, colors and tonality.</td>', 'Even though I don''t even want to know what it is, I think this is the best photo in the challenge. Well designed and executed. Great composition, colors and tonality.', '2006-11-29 13:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072065, 432926, 69183, '<td valign="top">The subject''s eyes are striking, but the skin (especially around the mouth and nose) seems devoid of detail and very plastic, which I thought was a shame because it lost a lot of the impact of the photo for me.</td>', 'The subject''s eyes are striking, but the skin (especially around the mouth and nose) seems devoid of detail and very plastic, which I thought was a shame because it lost a lot of the impact of the photo for me.', '2006-11-29 13:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072069, 432801, 69183, '<td valign="top">Nice one, I like it.</td>', 'Nice one, I like it.', '2006-11-29 13:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072073, 430958, 35994, '<td valign="top">lmao, that''s really nasty looking, but very funny</td>', 'lmao, that''s really nasty looking, but very funny', '2006-11-29 13:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072074, 432753, 69183, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah! Very nice caption :)</td>', 'Oh yeah! Very nice caption :)', '2006-11-29 13:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072079, 432912, 60862, '<td valign="top">Not sure what you were trying to show, but I''m not getting it.  That said, those definitely qualify in the ironic sense of the challenge!</td>', 'Not sure what you were trying to show, but I''m not getting it.  That said, those definitely qualify in the ironic sense of the challenge!', '2006-11-29 13:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072081, 432622, 69183, '<td valign="top">I like this, but I think it would be better if the depth of field covered the whole of the mushroom rather than the front of the mushroom and the pine needles in the foreground.</td>', 'I like this, but I think it would be better if the depth of field covered the whole of the mushroom rather than the front of the mushroom and the pine needles in the foreground.', '2006-11-29 13:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072084, 432752, 60862, '<td valign="top">Umm, what''s the point?  Sorry, this isn''t working for me.  Those words meet the ironic nature of the challenge, but did you mean to show something unpleasant happening after they were uttered?</td>', 'Umm, what''s the point?  Sorry, this isn''t working for me.  Those words meet the ironic nature of the challenge, but did you mean to show something unpleasant happening after they were uttered?', '2006-11-29 13:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072087, 432805, 13207, '<td valign="top">What a great idea for a shot!  I love this photo - a new favorite for me!</td>', 'What a great idea for a shot!  I love this photo - a new favorite for me!', '2006-11-29 13:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072089, 432595, 60862, '<td valign="top">How do these bills relate to the words, other than that they appear on the money?  And how are those words "last" words in some sense?  Maybe your notes will help explain it?  Sometimes context provided by comments makes all the difference in the world, but DPC focuses on purely the image and title.<br/> <br/>Aside from that, the shot is dimly lit with low contrast.</td>', 'How do these bills relate to the words, other than that they appear on the money?  And how are those words "last" words in some sense?  Maybe your notes will help explain it?  Sometimes context provided by comments makes all the difference in the world, but DPC focuses on purely the image and title. Aside from that, the shot is dimly lit with low contrast.', '2006-11-29 13:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072098, 431426, 69183, '<td valign="top">I like it; the "nobody" isn''t immediately apparent, which is very good. It''s a shame the subject is a bit out of focus and overexposed tho - was that intentional?</td>', 'I like it; the "nobody" isn''t immediately apparent, which is very good. It''s a shame the subject is a bit out of focus and overexposed tho - was that intentional?', '2006-11-29 13:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072099, 432565, 60862, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t meet the challenge.  It''s not just "words that match a photo," but rather either "last" words or ironically optimistic words that prove disastrous in the end.<br/> <br/>As a photo, the bird''s pretty funny looking (which is good!), and your title matches well.  It might have worked better, though, to have him over on the right and show something of what he''s looking at on the left.  Centered compositions can work, but to me, not here.</td>', 'Doesn''t meet the challenge.  It''s not just "words that match a photo," but rather either "last" words or ironically optimistic words that prove disastrous in the end. As a photo, the bird''s pretty funny looking (which is good!), and your title matches well.  It might have worked better, though, to have him over on the right and show something of what he''s looking at on the left.  Centered compositions can work, but to me, not here.', '2006-11-29 13:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072108, 432924, 69183, '<td valign="top">He really does look like he needs a cuddle. Very nice.</td>', 'He really does look like he needs a cuddle. Very nice.', '2006-11-29 13:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072111, 431809, 60862, '<td valign="top">Are those the last words of someone famous?  I hope you explain in your comments.<br/> <br/>As a photo, I''m afraid the focus is on the middle of the barrel.  It''s usually more gripping when the focus is right on the end, where the bad things happen like bullets coming out.</td>', 'Are those the last words of someone famous?  I hope you explain in your comments. As a photo, I''m afraid the focus is on the middle of the barrel.  It''s usually more gripping when the focus is right on the end, where the bad things happen like bullets coming out.', '2006-11-29 13:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072115, 432665, 69183, '<td valign="top">Wow. This must have taken quite a few attempts. I love the shape of the flames</td>', 'Wow. This must have taken quite a few attempts. I love the shape of the flames', '2006-11-29 13:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072116, 431535, 60862, '<td valign="top">Good famous last words, but this photo doesn''t really interpret them.  Simply having the word "long" visible doesn''t relate to the idea of taking longer than you expected.  But it''s a nice shot.</td>', 'Good famous last words, but this photo doesn''t really interpret them.  Simply having the word "long" visible doesn''t relate to the idea of taking longer than you expected.  But it''s a nice shot.', '2006-11-29 13:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072117, 432579, 60862, '<td valign="top">Good last words, but the shot doesn''t relate to it.  You need to show someone getting lost. :)</td>', 'Good last words, but the shot doesn''t relate to it.  You need to show someone getting lost. :)', '2006-11-29 13:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072119, 431050, 60862, '<td valign="top">Good concept, so you get some bonus for that.  But this shot is blurry.</td>', 'Good concept, so you get some bonus for that.  But this shot is blurry.', '2006-11-29 13:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072127, 432664, 60862, '<td valign="top">Funny shot, but blurry to the point of being distracting.  I do like him over there on the side, though.</td>', 'Funny shot, but blurry to the point of being distracting.  I do like him over there on the side, though.', '2006-11-29 13:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072132, 432412, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but unlike at least one other, there''s no sense of the trouble a gun can cause.  It needs something connecting the gun to bad consequences of the title not being true.  This feels too much like a documentary shot of a gun, not a demonstration of the title.</td>', 'I like the concept, but unlike at least one other, there''s no sense of the trouble a gun can cause.  It needs something connecting the gun to bad consequences of the title not being true.  This feels too much like a documentary shot of a gun, not a demonstration of the title.', '2006-11-29 13:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072148, 430958, 66635, '<td valign="top">Are the people who are asking what this is joking?  Does anyone really not recognize it as a condom?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-12-06 04:56:47.</i></td>', 'Are the people who are asking what this is joking?  Does anyone really not recognize it as a condom?', '2006-11-29 13:30:26.000000', '2006-12-06 04:56:47.000000', 1),
(3072158, 432674, 66635, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really fit the challenge at all.  What is that thing, anyway?  It''s not a gun.</td>', 'Doesn''t really fit the challenge at all.  What is that thing, anyway?  It''s not a gun.', '2006-11-29 13:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072160, 432883, 69183, '<td valign="top">I really like this - the flecks of paint, the shadows and highlights of the peeling wallpaper. It''s just like being at home ;)  Very nice.</td>', 'I really like this - the flecks of paint, the shadows and highlights of the peeling wallpaper. It''s just like being at home ;)  Very nice.', '2006-11-29 13:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072165, 432784, 69183, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. The sky is a bit odd in the top right, bit I suspect that''s just jpeg artifacts. Great light on the sand and the mountains in the distance.</td>', 'Lovely shot. The sky is a bit odd in the top right, bit I suspect that''s just jpeg artifacts. Great light on the sand and the mountains in the distance.', '2006-11-29 13:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072167, 432619, 69221, '<td valign="top">Her eyes caught mine, her expression is intensely melancholic, you cannot tell if she is about to smile or to cry. There is so much to feel about this picture, it is fantastic.</td>', 'Her eyes caught mine, her expression is intensely melancholic, you cannot tell if she is about to smile or to cry. There is so much to feel about this picture, it is fantastic.', '2006-11-29 13:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072169, 432595, 69183, '<td valign="top">A lot of the notes seem to be out of focus, and I''m not sure whether they''re laid out that way for a reason?</td>', 'A lot of the notes seem to be out of focus, and I''m not sure whether they''re laid out that way for a reason?', '2006-11-29 13:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3072179, 432062, 69183, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I almost thought it was three eyes from one person for a moment. I love the rust marks and the detail on the metal as well as the stares from the subjects.</td>', 'Very nice. I almost thought it was three eyes from one person for a moment. I love the rust marks and the detail on the metal as well as the stares from the subjects.', '2006-11-29 13:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
