(3072307, 431050, 68256, '<td valign="top">Harsh lighting and having the subject so centered made me grade this low,  I do like how you met the challenge though!</td>', 'Harsh lighting and having the subject so centered made me grade this low,  I do like how you met the challenge though!', '2006-11-29 14:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
