(3080792, 432140, 67671, '<td valign="top">roasted nuts comes to mind, I think this is one of the best ideas hear, not keen on the b&amp;w color mix, but that''s how you wanted it, so I accept that,the frame is perfect, as is the location, and exposure, one of two tens I gave in this challange. great stuff</td>', 'roasted nuts comes to mind, I think this is one of the best ideas hear, not keen on the b&w color mix, but that''s how you wanted it, so I accept that,the frame is perfect, as is the location, and exposure, one of two tens I gave in this challange. great stuff', '2006-12-01 23:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
