(3080868, 432738, 13688, '<td valign="top">i find this composition very interesting.  i feel the photographer needs to legitimize him/herself  by making the moon crisper and there being less noise in the shadows, and I wish I didn''t have to.</td>', 'i find this composition very interesting.  i feel the photographer needs to legitimize him/herself  by making the moon crisper and there being less noise in the shadows, and I wish I didn''t have to.', '2006-12-02 00:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3080876, 432377, 13688, '<td valign="top">nicely timed capture.  the stick commands too much attention though.  i would have cropped down to just the face and taken my chances if it wasn''t super crisp (though it looks prety crisp as is).  a close up of the background texture contrasted with the lines of the face and the fur on the neck would have been very interesting for me.</td>', 'nicely timed capture.  the stick commands too much attention though.  i would have cropped down to just the face and taken my chances if it wasn''t super crisp (though it looks prety crisp as is).  a close up of the background texture contrasted with the lines of the face and the fur on the neck would have been very interesting for me.', '2006-12-02 00:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3080893, 432629, 13688, '<td valign="top">perhaps a wider angle would make this more interesting for me.  Forgive my lack of experience, but is this thing used for product photography?</td>', 'perhaps a wider angle would make this more interesting for me.  Forgive my lack of experience, but is this thing used for product photography?', '2006-12-02 00:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3080901, 432580, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice idea.  seems like the time piece could have been an oppurtunity to add a bit of hurried feel to the image by setting the clock to 9 seconds before 12...perhaps it was broken, at which point it would be probably safer to not mess with the wires ;)</td>', 'nice idea.  seems like the time piece could have been an oppurtunity to add a bit of hurried feel to the image by setting the clock to 9 seconds before 12...perhaps it was broken, at which point it would be probably safer to not mess with the wires ;)', '2006-12-02 00:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3080904, 431972, 13688, '<td valign="top">this photo kind of makes me feel very uncomfortable...i kind of like that.  Though it doesn''t make me want to stare too long.</td>', 'this photo kind of makes me feel very uncomfortable...i kind of like that.  Though it doesn''t make me want to stare too long.', '2006-12-02 00:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3080911, 431853, 13688, '<td valign="top">i''m quacking up.  i wish your background was more balanced...and oddly, your border aswell.</td>', 'i''m quacking up.  i wish your background was more balanced...and oddly, your border aswell.', '2006-12-02 00:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3080915, 431566, 13688, '<td valign="top">i''m curious if this was able to be done standing at 1 end or if you had to walk through the scene shining the light on the wall, as the light seems very concentrated in bands.  Perhaps this would have more appeal for me if there wasn''t so much light and if you had someone in the pic, seemimgly lost</td>', 'i''m curious if this was able to be done standing at 1 end or if you had to walk through the scene shining the light on the wall, as the light seems very concentrated in bands.  Perhaps this would have more appeal for me if there wasn''t so much light and if you had someone in the pic, seemimgly lost', '2006-12-02 00:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3080920, 432512, 13688, '<td valign="top">i''m seeing someone trying to see out of one of your windows with that much snow on the ledge, with the expression "oh my i''m never getting out the door"</td>', 'i''m seeing someone trying to see out of one of your windows with that much snow on the ledge, with the expression "oh my i''m never getting out the door"', '2006-12-02 00:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3080928, 431535, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting contrast.  obviously this would really work if the long was written across the roof of the building that was about to collapse.  Then again maybe if you called it "Not Long"... or then again maybe you were going for "it won''t be long when it''s gone as the other building will always be long".  Maybe I''m missing some underlying nuance completely and i''ll just stop typing now.  But before that I''ll mention that I''m interested to find out if commenters find this oversharpened.  I''m sure you''re really glad I mentioned that.  Good luck.</td>', 'interesting contrast.  obviously this would really work if the long was written across the roof of the building that was about to collapse.  Then again maybe if you called it "Not Long"... or then again maybe you were going for "it won''t be long when it''s gone as the other building will always be long".  Maybe I''m missing some underlying nuance completely and i''ll just stop typing now.  But before that I''ll mention that I''m interested to find out if commenters find this oversharpened.  I''m sure you''re really glad I mentioned that.  Good luck.', '2006-12-02 00:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3080932, 432664, 13688, '<td valign="top">I am left wondering what prompted this poor soul to have to eat your socks.  I''m also left wondering if Bart Simpson the European version requests this instead of shorts.  I''m afraid other than a bit of fuzz on the end your sock it more resembles a piece being cut out of my monitor...not that, that effect isn''t very interesting on it''s own.</td>', 'I am left wondering what prompted this poor soul to have to eat your socks.  I''m also left wondering if Bart Simpson the European version requests this instead of shorts.  I''m afraid other than a bit of fuzz on the end your sock it more resembles a piece being cut out of my monitor...not that, that effect isn''t very interesting on it''s own.', '2006-12-02 00:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3080934, 432784, 42495, '<td valign="top">Great job on creating the sense of open space.</td>', 'Great job on creating the sense of open space.', '2006-12-02 00:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3080935, 431283, 42495, '<td valign="top">That''s just too funny.</td>', 'That''s just too funny.', '2006-12-02 00:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3080937, 432530, 13688, '<td valign="top">this photo has a strong message...i like photo''s that actually impart something to think about.  Your intoxicated title adds a bit of uncomfortable humor to the message...i''m curious if that was your intent.</td>', 'this photo has a strong message...i like photo''s that actually impart something to think about.  Your intoxicated title adds a bit of uncomfortable humor to the message...i''m curious if that was your intent.', '2006-12-02 01:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3080955, 432345, 13688, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see a revolution on this site.  Unfortunately, very few men among them has any idea of photography ;)  Oh and the image, yes it''s clever as always.</td>', 'I''d like to see a revolution on this site.  Unfortunately, very few men among them has any idea of photography ;)  Oh and the image, yes it''s clever as always.', '2006-12-02 01:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3080963, 431431, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting image.  i like how the flame seems to be yearning to light the other.  like it is the spirit of the living trying to bring back that of the dead that has just recently gone out.  i think i''ve been on dpchallenge to long as i wish there was more contrast and not so much of a yellow cast</td>', 'interesting image.  i like how the flame seems to be yearning to light the other.  like it is the spirit of the living trying to bring back that of the dead that has just recently gone out.  i think i''ve been on dpchallenge to long as i wish there was more contrast and not so much of a yellow cast', '2006-12-02 01:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3080970, 430716, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice setup, i didn''t realize how clever this was until i looked down and saw the title...though with fair skin like that, I do believe the Mediterranean sun would have killed Caesar before Brutus did.</td>', 'nice setup, i didn''t realize how clever this was until i looked down and saw the title...though with fair skin like that, I do believe the Mediterranean sun would have killed Caesar before Brutus did.', '2006-12-02 01:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3080979, 431283, 13688, '<td valign="top">...tell Inspector Jones from Child Protective Services he can wait, we''re busy in here.  She sure seems happy though.</td>', '...tell Inspector Jones from Child Protective Services he can wait, we''re busy in here.  She sure seems happy though.', '2006-12-02 01:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3080981, 432581, 13688, '<td valign="top">i like the idea.  but if you''re going to do this shot, you''ve got to be dead on with the drip hanging off the end and a perfect white balance</td>', 'i like the idea.  but if you''re going to do this shot, you''ve got to be dead on with the drip hanging off the end and a perfect white balance', '2006-12-02 01:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081137, 432889, 61379, '<td valign="top">oh yeah,so true.....! nice idea.</td>', 'oh yeah,so true.....! nice idea.', '2006-12-02 06:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081261, 432777, 68372, '<td valign="top">I would have done this composition differently.<br/>I find the gun to be too tight at the bottom of the image.<br/>And I don''t really like the way the frame with a picture was cut.  I find it is disturbing and competitioning with the main subject since it is taking so much space in the composition.</td>', 'I would have done this composition differently.I find the gun to be too tight at the bottom of the image.And I don''t really like the way the frame with a picture was cut.  I find it is disturbing and competitioning with the main subject since it is taking so much space in the composition.', '2006-12-02 08:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081266, 432920, 68372, '<td valign="top">This looks like a regular snapshot.<br/>The image is not straight.<br/>The flash is creating a shadow.<br/>Maybe try another viewpoint to create a more dramatic effect.</td>', 'This looks like a regular snapshot.The image is not straight.The flash is creating a shadow.Maybe try another viewpoint to create a more dramatic effect.', '2006-12-02 08:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
