(3087801, 432277, 53814, '<td valign="top">I think you should resize this to the largest (640) pixel size (width) that is legal. At 572 pixels the viewer is missing out on some of the available detail. Also, the composition might be helped with a "rule of thirds" crop or by shooting at a lower angle. -6</td>', 'I think you should resize this to the largest (640) pixel size (width) that is legal. At 572 pixels the viewer is missing out on some of the available detail. Also, the composition might be helped with a "rule of thirds" crop or by shooting at a lower angle. -6', '2006-12-04 22:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
