(3087811, 430958, 60770, '<td valign="top">Oh that''s dirty. Dirty, dirty, dirty. The reflection makes it even dirtier. Nice shot though. Did you consider some amount of context? It might be nice to tame the shock value a little. I''ll be curious to see if people are too grossed out to really look at it.</td>', 'Oh that''s dirty. Dirty, dirty, dirty. The reflection makes it even dirtier. Nice shot though. Did you consider some amount of context? It might be nice to tame the shock value a little. I''ll be curious to see if people are too grossed out to really look at it.', '2006-12-04 22:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
