(3091441, 432610, 40126, '<td valign="top">Some people commented it was so orange. Actually it is. it''s a "WHITE Elephant", as they say. This is evidenced by its'' pinkish skin and WHITISH eyes. This was taken sundown. Light being cast from the ground reflected on the face. Thus the orangy cast.<br/> <br/>some thought it was over processed. actually, when I hit autocontrast and auto-color, this is what I got. I adjusted saturation just a tad. I like the color this way, FIERY, it''s so unique. Although, as Pointandshoot commented, I was punished for it, still, I think its gorgeous, perfect for a Thailand postcard. Thanks for those who have given me a vote higher than my average.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//img.photobucket.com/albums/v312/davidus428/Portfolio/D2Dav14115-Elephant-Eye-2.jpg'', strrpos(''//img.photobucket.com/albums/v312/davidus428/Portfolio/D2Dav14115-Elephant-Eye-2.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//img.photobucket.com/albums/v312/davidus428/Portfolio/D2Dav14115-Elephant-Eye-2.jpg"/> <br/> <br/>there was a debate on the forum regarding "misunderstanding" and different interpretations of the challenge. If I only knew... (just read forum on Famous Last Words Scores)... i would have just titled my entry...<br/> <br/>"Don''t worry it can''t reach us" or simply "She''s harmless."<br/> <br/>I thought I''d get a higher score for doing something creative. Oh well, as they say, this is DPC. Little chance you can please the MAJORITY here. <br/> <br/>Peace!  <br/></td>', 'Some people commented it was so orange. Actually it is. it''s a "WHITE Elephant", as they say. This is evidenced by its'' pinkish skin and WHITISH eyes. This was taken sundown. Light being cast from the ground reflected on the face. Thus the orangy cast. some thought it was over processed. actually, when I hit autocontrast and auto-color, this is what I got. I adjusted saturation just a tad. I like the color this way, FIERY, it''s so unique. Although, as Pointandshoot commented, I was punished for it, still, I think its gorgeous, perfect for a Thailand postcard. Thanks for those who have given me a vote higher than my average.   there was a debate on the forum regarding "misunderstanding" and different interpretations of the challenge. If I only knew... (just read forum on Famous Last Words Scores)... i would have just titled my entry... "Don''t worry it can''t reach us" or simply "She''s harmless." I thought I''d get a higher score for doing something creative. Oh well, as they say, this is DPC. Little chance you can please the MAJORITY here.  Peace!  ', '2006-12-06 03:00:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(3091448, 430870, 56322, '<td valign="top">I''m disappointed a little by the result of my picture... I though it was better :p (thank you gurlwithapen for the fav) It was maybe too abstract for that contest...<br/>About the picture : there is no advanced editing in this !! The angel was fixed behind by a cable, which disappeared in the DOF... There are only crop and contrast...</td>', 'I''m disappointed a little by the result of my picture... I though it was better :p (thank you gurlwithapen for the fav) It was maybe too abstract for that contest...About the picture : there is no advanced editing in this !! The angel was fixed behind by a cable, which disappeared in the DOF... There are only crop and contrast...', '2006-12-06 03:03:52.000000', NULL, 0),
