(3092278, 432665, 62925, '<td valign="top">and it wasn''t a "suicide note" mearly a note stating his retirement from the music industry, the last part of hte note was forged by Good ol'' Courtney Love. he was murdered!</td>', 'and it wasn''t a "suicide note" mearly a note stating his retirement from the music industry, the last part of hte note was forged by Good ol'' Courtney Love. he was murdered!', '2006-12-06 09:49:59.000000', NULL, 0),
