(3093355, 432785, 50695, '<td valign="top">right choice to make this cartoonish. even I had to concede you a 7. congrats on your finish. thanks for the laugh!</td>', 'right choice to make this cartoonish. even I had to concede you a 7. congrats on your finish. thanks for the laugh!', '2006-12-06 15:25:06.000000', NULL, 0),
