(3093889, 432881, 41337, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Younger:</b></div><hr/><i> Thank you all very very much for the votes and the great feedback.<br/>I entered this in the diagonal challenge first but after a day I thought of this title and moved it to this challenge. Glad I did.<br/>I really thought the beach was too dirty to look really good but I see it was overlooked in favor of the subject - as I had hoped.<br/>WOW, I''m still pinching myself! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''d imagine it would have ribboned in the diagonal challenge as well but definitely does fit this challenge to a tee.</td>', 'Originally posted by Younger: Thank you all very very much for the votes and the great feedback.I entered this in the diagonal challenge first but after a day I thought of this title and moved it to this challenge. Glad I did.I really thought the beach was too dirty to look really good but I see it was overlooked in favor of the subject - as I had hoped.WOW, I''m still pinching myself!   I''d imagine it would have ribboned in the diagonal challenge as well but definitely does fit this challenge to a tee.', '2006-12-06 17:43:56.000000', NULL, 0),
