(3094873, 430958, 28710, '<td valign="top">That''s disgusting. Sadly, it reminds me of a friend of my mother''s whose husband deliberately sabotaged his prophylactics because he wanted children and didn''t give a ____ about what his wife thought.<br/> <br/>He had 4 children this way, one of which has severe physical handicaps, one of which has moderate ADD and the other two are fairly normal teenagers... <br/> <br/>Of course he left her for a younger woman after his deeds were done and the story is actually much longer and much more heartbreaking than this, but that''s what it reminds me of.<br/> <br/>It''s also a good reminder for the reality of the responsibility that people undergo when engaging in sex. Especially youngsters who have little real education in such matters.</td>', 'That''s disgusting. Sadly, it reminds me of a friend of my mother''s whose husband deliberately sabotaged his prophylactics because he wanted children and didn''t give a ____ about what his wife thought. He had 4 children this way, one of which has severe physical handicaps, one of which has moderate ADD and the other two are fairly normal teenagers...  Of course he left her for a younger woman after his deeds were done and the story is actually much longer and much more heartbreaking than this, but that''s what it reminds me of. It''s also a good reminder for the reality of the responsibility that people undergo when engaging in sex. Especially youngsters who have little real education in such matters.', '2006-12-06 23:30:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3094886, 432595, 28710, '<td valign="top">No offense, but photographically, this is an awful pic. <br/> <br/>Content wise on the other hand, it''s totally great!<br/> <br/>I''ve always found such a powerful irony in the statement on money ''In God We Trust".<br/> <br/>It''s hard to portray, but kudos for giving it a whirl!</td>', 'No offense, but photographically, this is an awful pic.  Content wise on the other hand, it''s totally great! I''ve always found such a powerful irony in the statement on money ''In God We Trust". It''s hard to portray, but kudos for giving it a whirl!', '2006-12-06 23:33:34.000000', NULL, 0),
